  "title": "Summer Chicken Burgers",
  "description": "A mouthwatering grilled chicken breast burger recipe with caramelized onion, provolone, and avocado on a toasted bun. Easy sandwiches that satisfy.",
  "authors": [
    "Elisa Gale"
  ],
